@TiendaUCN_HostAddress = http://localhost:5121

###
# ===========================================
# 🛒 TIENDA UCN - GUÍA COMPLETA DE ENDPOINTS
# ===========================================
# Aplicación corriendo en: http://localhost:5121
# Base de datos: SQLite (app.db)
# ===========================================

###
# ===========================================
# 🔐 AUTENTICACIÓN Y REGISTRO
# ===========================================

### 1. REGISTRO DE USUARIO
# POST /api/auth/register
# Registra un nuevo usuario y envía código de verificación por email
# NOTA: El DTO requiere campos adicionales según RegisterDTO.cs
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Pérez",
  "gender": "Masculino",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-15",
  "rut": "12345678-9",
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "phone": "+56912345678",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123!"
}

### 2. VERIFICAR EMAIL
# POST /api/auth/verify
# Verifica el código enviado al email para activar cuenta
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/auth/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "code": "123456"
}

### 3. LOGIN
# POST /api/auth/login
# Inicia sesión y obtiene JWT token
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### 4. RECUPERAR CONTRASEÑA
# POST /api/auth/recover-password
# Envía código de recuperación por email
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/auth/recover-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com"
}

### 5. RESET CONTRASEÑA
# PATCH /api/auth/reset-password
# Cambia contraseña usando código de recuperación
PATCH {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "code": "123456",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}

### 6. REENVIAR CÓDIGO DE VERIFICACIÓN
# POST /api/auth/resend-verification
# Reenvía código de verificación por email si el usuario no está verificado
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com"
}

###
# ===========================================
# 👤 GESTIÓN DE PERFIL DE USUARIO
# ===========================================
# ⚠️ REQUIERE AUTENTICACIÓN (Bearer Token)

### 6. OBTENER PERFIL
# GET /api/user/profile
GET {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 7. ACTUALIZAR PERFIL
# PUT /api/user/profile
PUT {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan Carlos",
  "lastName": "Pérez González",
  "phoneNumber": "+56987654321"
}

### 8. VERIFICAR CAMBIO DE EMAIL
# POST /api/user/verify-code-email
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/user/verify-code-email
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "123456"
}

###
# ===========================================
# 🛍️ PRODUCTOS PÚBLICOS
# ===========================================

### 9. LISTAR PRODUCTOS
# GET /api/products
# Parámetros opcionales: page, pageSize, search, categoryId, brandId, minPrice, maxPrice, sortBy, sortOrder
GET {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=10&search=laptop&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc

### 10. OBTENER PRODUCTO POR ID
# GET /api/products/{id}
GET {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/products/1

###
# ===========================================
# 🛒 CARRITO DE COMPRAS
# ===========================================
# ⚠️ REQUIERE AUTENTICACIÓN (Bearer Token)

### 11. OBTENER CARRITO
# GET /api/cart
GET {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 12. AGREGAR ITEM AL CARRITO
# POST /api/cart/items
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="productId"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="quantity"

2
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 13. ACTUALIZAR CANTIDAD DE ITEM
# PUT /api/cart/items/{productId}
PUT {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="quantity"

5
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 14. ELIMINAR ITEM DEL CARRITO
# DELETE /api/cart/items/{productId}
DELETE {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 15. CHECKOUT (REALIZAR PEDIDO)
# POST /api/cart/checkout
# ⚠️ Solo para usuarios con rol "Customer"
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/cart/checkout
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

###
# ===========================================
# 👑 ADMINISTRACIÓN - USUARIOS
# ===========================================
# ⚠️ REQUIERE AUTENTICACIÓN + ROL ADMIN

### 16. LISTAR USUARIOS
# GET /api/admin/users
# Parámetros: page, pageSize, search, role, status, sortBy, sortOrder
GET {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/users?page=1&pageSize=10&role=Customer&status=Active
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 17. OBTENER USUARIO POR ID
# GET /api/admin/users/{id}
GET {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/users/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 18. ACTUALIZAR ESTADO DE USUARIO
# PATCH /api/admin/users/{id}/status
PATCH {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/users/1/status
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isLocked": true,
  "reason": "Violación de términos de servicio"
}

### 19. ACTUALIZAR ROL DE USUARIO
# PATCH /api/admin/users/{id}/role
PATCH {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/users/1/role
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newRole": "Admin"
}

###
# ===========================================
# 👑 ADMINISTRACIÓN - PRODUCTOS
# ===========================================
# ⚠️ REQUIERE AUTENTICACIÓN + ROL ADMIN

### 20. LISTAR PRODUCTOS (ADMIN)
# GET /api/admin/products
# Parámetros: page, pageSize, search, categoryId, brandId, status, sortBy, sortOrder
GET {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products?page=1&pageSize=10&status=Available
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 21. OBTENER PRODUCTO POR ID (ADMIN)
# GET /api/admin/products/{id}
GET {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 22. CREAR PRODUCTO
# POST /api/admin/products
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Gaming XYZ",
  "title": "Laptop Gaming XYZ 15.6\"",
  "description": "Potente laptop para gaming con RTX 4060",
  "price": 1299990,
  "stock": 50,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "brandId": 1,
  "isAvailable": true
}

### 23. ACTUALIZAR PRODUCTO
# PUT /api/admin/products/{id}
PUT {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Gaming XYZ Updated",
  "title": "Laptop Gaming XYZ 15.6\" Updated",
  "description": "Potente laptop para gaming con RTX 4060 - Edición Especial",
  "price": 1399990,
  "stock": 45,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "brandId": 1,
  "isAvailable": true
}

### 24. ELIMINAR PRODUCTO (SOFT DELETE)
# DELETE /api/admin/products/{id}
DELETE {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 25. SUBIR IMAGEN A PRODUCTO
# POST /api/admin/products/{id}/images
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products/1/images
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="laptop.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /path/to/your/image.jpg >
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 26. ELIMINAR IMAGEN DE PRODUCTO
# DELETE /api/admin/products/{id}/images/{publicId}
DELETE {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products/1/images/your_image_public_id
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 27. ACTUALIZAR ESTADO DE PRODUCTO
# PATCH /api/admin/products/{id}/status
PATCH {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products/1/status
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isAvailable": false
}

### 28. ACTUALIZAR DESCUENTO DE PRODUCTO
# PATCH /api/admin/products/{id}/discount
PATCH {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products/1/discount
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discount": 15.5
}

###
# ===========================================
# 👑 ADMINISTRACIÓN - CATEGORÍAS
# ===========================================
# ⚠️ REQUIERE AUTENTICACIÓN + ROL ADMIN

### 29. LISTAR CATEGORÍAS
# GET /api/admin/categories
GET {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 30. CREAR CATEGORÍA
# POST /api/admin/categories
POST {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electrónicos",
  "description": "Productos electrónicos y tecnología"
}

### 31. ACTUALIZAR CATEGORÍA
# PUT /api/admin/categories/{id}
PUT {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electrónicos y Tecnología",
  "description": "Productos electrónicos, computadoras y tecnología"
}

### 32. ELIMINAR CATEGORÍA
# DELETE /api/admin/categories/{id}
DELETE {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

###
# ===========================================
# 👑 ADMINISTRACIÓN - ÓRDENES/PEDIDOS
# ===========================================
# ⚠️ REQUIERE AUTENTICACIÓN + ROL ADMIN

### 33. LISTAR ÓRDENES
# GET /api/admin/orders
# Parámetros: page, pageSize, status, customerEmail, dateFrom, dateTo, sortBy, sortOrder
GET {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/orders?page=1&pageSize=10&status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 34. OBTENER ORDEN POR ID
# GET /api/admin/orders/{id}
GET {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 35. ACTUALIZAR ESTADO DE ORDEN
# PATCH /api/admin/orders/{id}/status
PATCH {{TiendaUCN_HostAddress}}/api/admin/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newStatus": "Shipped"
}

###
# ===========================================
# 📋 INSTRUCCIONES PARA TESTING
# ===========================================

# 1. REGISTRO Y LOGIN:
#    - Primero registra un usuario (endpoint 1)
#    - Verifica el email (endpoint 2) o reenvía código (endpoint 6)
#    - Haz login para obtener JWT token (endpoint 3)

# USUARIO DE PRUEBA FIJO:
#    - Email: juan.perez@example.com
#    - Password: Test123!
#    - Estado: No verificado (para probar resend-verification)

# 2. TESTING DE PRODUCTOS:
#    - Lista productos públicos (endpoint 9)
#    - Obtén detalles de un producto (endpoint 10)

# 3. TESTING DE CARRITO:
#    - Agrega items al carrito (endpoint 12)
#    - Actualiza cantidades (endpoint 13)
#    - Elimina items (endpoint 14)
#    - Revisa el carrito (endpoint 11)

# 4. TESTING ADMIN (REQUIERE USUARIO ADMIN):
#    - Gestiona usuarios (endpoints 16-19)
#    - Gestiona productos (endpoints 20-28)
#    - Gestiona categorías (endpoints 29-32)
#    - Gestiona órdenes (endpoints 33-35)

# 5. TOKENS:
#    - Reemplaza YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE con el token obtenido del login
#    - Reemplaza YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE con token de usuario admin

# 6. NOTAS IMPORTANTES:
#    - Algunos endpoints requieren roles específicos
#    - Las imágenes se suben como multipart/form-data
#    - Los endpoints de paginación incluyen headers X-Pagination-*
#    - Las fechas usan formato ISO 8601
#    - Los precios están en pesos chilenos (sin decimales)

###
